MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The portable SSD fits the practical laptop accessories I have been choosing: it would help me move files and keep portable backups without requiring a larger setup.",
    "The over-ear headphones offer a plausible upgrade from my wired headphones, while the microSD card connects to my previous memory-card purchases and Raspberry Pi projects, provided it is compatible."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The streaming sticks, smart display, and surveillance bundle introduce activities I have not shown a current need for; buying computer accessories does not mean I am looking to build a connected home.",
    "Storage capacity alone does not make the enterprise hard drive useful to me, and earbuds do not serve the same preference as my on-ear headphones and gaming headset. The portable SSD and over-ear option fit my intended use more closely."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The suggestions seem to treat my interest in electronics as a reason to offer broadly related gadgets, even when they do not help with my computer setup or projects.",
    "My headphone and memory-card purchases seem to have been stretched into interest in any personal audio or storage product, overlooking differences in wearing style, portability, and equipment requirements."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent choices emphasize maintaining and organizing a working computer setup, including wired networking, cable management, cleaning, and carrying accessories.",
    "I care about whether an upgrade fits the equipment I already use: a larger microSD card needs compatibility checking, and an internal enterprise drive would require a suitable setup that my history does not establish."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "You partly understood my interest in useful computer and audio upgrades, but stretched it too far into unrelated gadgets and products with different practical requirements."
}
